    <preface>
      <p>Economic Recovery Package (JobMaker Hiring Credit) Amendment Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 96, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Coronavirus Economic Response Package (Payments and Benefits) Act 2020</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Coronavirus Economic Response Package (Payments and Benefits) Act 2020	3</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Coronavirus Economic Response Package (Payments and Benefits) Act 2020</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 13 November 2020</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the<i> </i><i>Economic Recovery Package (JobMaker Hiring Credit) Amendment</i><i> Act 20</i><i>20</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>14 November 2020</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Coronavirus Economic Response Package (Payments and Benefits) Act 2020</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Section 3</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “to is to provide financial support to entities”, substitute “is to provide financial support directly or indirectly to entities that are”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Section 6</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>relevant</i></b><b><i> period</i></b> means the period between 7 October 2020 and 6 October 2022.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>After subsection 7(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>The rules may also make provision for and in relation to:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-1A__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(a)	one or more kinds of payments by the Commonwealth to an entity in respect of a time that occurs during the relevant period, being payments that are primarily<i> </i>for the purpose of:</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-1A__para-i">
                    <num>i</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>improving the prospects of individuals getting employment in Australia; or</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-1A__para-ii">
                    <num>ii</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>increasing workforce participation in Australia; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-1A__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the establishment of a scheme providing for matters relating to one or more those payments, and matters relating to such a scheme.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Paragraphs (a) and (b) do not limit each other.</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Subsection 7(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “subsection (1)”, substitute “subsections (1) and (1A)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>At the end of the Act</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-21">
                  <num>21</num>
                  <heading>Constitutional basis for this Act</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>Principal constitutional basis</p>
                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-21__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>This Act relies on the legislative power that the Parliament has under the Constitution with respect to matters that are peculiarly adapted to the government of a nation and cannot otherwise be carried on for the benefit of the nation.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Additional constitutional basis</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-21__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>This Act also relies on all other legislative powers that the Parliament has under the Constitution relevant to a kind of Coronavirus economic response payment.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                      <p><i>House of Representatives on 7 October 2020</i></p>
                      <p><i>Senate on 9 November 2020</i>]</p>
                      <p>(126/20)</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
